# Top 30 Real-Time AWS Scenario-Based Interview Questions and Answers

These are practical, real-world AWS interview questions with answers in natural spoken English, the way you should explain them to an interviewer.

The focus is on situations you may face while working as an AWS Cloud Engineer, System Administrator, or DevOps Engineer.

I have included:

- Real production issues.
- Step-by-step troubleshooting.
- AWS services involved.
- Practical solutions.
- Interview-ready spoken answers.

# 1. EC2 – Real-Time Scenario Questions

